<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43344" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">segmentātus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		segmentum, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>ornamented with strips of tinsel</i>, etc.; <i>trimmed</i>, <i>flounced</i>, <i>purfled</i> (mostly postclass. and very rare).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cunae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Juv. 6,
					89</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amictus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Symm. Ep. 4, 42</span></i>
			: TORALIA, Inscr. Fratr. Arval. 32 and 41.—*
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">paginae Tulliano segmentatae auro,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Symm. Ep. 3, 12</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
